Below are lists of items added by SVE, that are universally loved, liked, considered neutral, disliked, or hated. Note that there are some '''exceptions''' and that individual [[Villagers|villager]] tastes override any universal tastes.

== Universal Loves ==

This is a list of items that almost every [[Villagers|villager]] loves to receive as a gift. These items are guaranteed to give the most points (80) towards your relationship, but may be difficult to obtain.

When given a loved gift, villagers usually respond with a heart dialogue bubble.  

*{{Name|Prismatic Pop}}
*{{Name|Golden Ocean Flower}}
*{{Name|Gold Slime Egg}}
*{{Name|Golden Goose Egg}}
*{{Name|Magic Lamp}}
*{{Name|Mega Purple Mushroom}}

=== Universal Loves exceptions ===

*{{NPCVanilla|Haley}} hates {{Name|Prismatic Pop}}.
*{{NPC|Andy}}, {{NPC|Apples}}, {{NPC|Lance}}, {{NPC|Magnus}}, {{NPC|Morgan}} and {{NPC|Marlon}} like {{Name|Golden Ocean Flower}}.

